## Reproducer

```bash
# Build "before" binary (W44-175 baseline)
cd ~/work/zen/jxl-encoder && \
  CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/zen/jxl-encoder-shared-target/b3_before \
  cargo build --release --bin cjxl-rs -p jxl-encoder-cli \
  --features 'butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel'

# Build "after" binary: apply the chunked-fan-out patch, then build
git stash apply ...  # patch applied in this session, not preserved long-term
cargo build --release ...  # into b3_after target dir

# Bench
/tmp/b3_perf_bench.sh /tmp/b3_perf_bench.tsv  # 7 iters, ~4 min
python3 /tmp/b3_analyze.py /tmp/b3_perf_bench.tsv
```
